        "upstream_review": null,
        "excerpt": "[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-22T13:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (multi_batch_11): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\nMultilingual batch 11: confirm the requested audience or locale before penalizing regional wording. Natural Southern Vietnamese vocabulary is not an error solely because a reviewer prefers a Northern term. Provide the exact phrase and prompt context. Send Korean cases to Hana, Japanese cases to Yuki, Vietnamese cases to Linh and Spanish cases to Leo. For register shifts, include the addressee and any quotation; an apparent shift is not an automatic major penalty."
      },
